        "name": "Response",
        "info": "DR setting genererar -\"19 - LoraWan parameter updated\"\nAnammar omedelbart ny SF\n\nADR förändringar genererar \"19 - LoraWan parameter updated\"\nÄndring ADR off inträder nog efter omstart. Ändring ADR on inträder direkt\n\n\nClear DevNonce ger en omedelbar omstart (re-join)\n\nADR och DR settings genererar 0x13,0x01 (19, 0x01) som svar att kommando nått fram\n\nNo transmission due to too Large loraWAN message results in transmission as several smaller packages on port 30 in following format:\nByte 1: Actual port number\nByte 2: Top Nibble: Packet number (1,2,3...osv) \nByte 2: Lower Nibble Total No of packets to be sent\nByte 3: Increasing No for each transmission (0-255) (Zeroes at restart)\nByte 4 .... Data\n",
